  "description": "A long time ago the first celestial emperor decided to create Cheonjihae, an organization of 27 beings with fantastic powers in charge of maintaining the peace of the celestial world. Our heroine is destined to become the “Yellow Dragon”, the main defender of this association. Will she succeed in protecting the fragile balance of the heavens, despite the growing tension between the different races? And what to do when the organization itself does not believe in its mission anymore?\n\n*Note: Includes 15 extra chapters.*",
